<view class="page {{deviceClass}} capture-page">
  <stemist-header eyebrow="STEM STUDIO · PRACTICE" title="拍一题" subtitle="One question · one evidence set" action-text="返回" bind:action="goBack" />
  <view class="subtitle capture-intro">每次只处理一道题。拍照后先裁剪，确认清晰再交给 AI Coach。</view>
  <view class="card camera-card">
    <view class="camera-icon">⌁</view>
    <view class="section-kicker">PHOTO WORKSPACE</view>
    <view class="card-title">后置摄像头 · 单题模式</view>
    <view class="card-detail">让题目、图表和你的答案尽量完整出现在同一张照片里；不要把多道题拼在一张图中。</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="takePhoto" loading="{{busy}}">{{busy ? '准备照片…' : '打开相机拍题'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{isTablet}}" class="context-card tablet-capture-guide">
    <view class="context-card-title">iPad 布局</view>
    <view class="context-card-text">宽屏下保留更大的取景和说明区域，横屏适合拍摄含图表的题目；仍然只提交当前这一题。</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="context-card phone-capture-guide">
    <view class="context-card-title">手机布局</view>
    <view class="context-card-text">竖屏单列，拍照按钮固定在主要内容之后，方便单手操作。</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="notice">小程序版不接 Apple Pencil；需要连续手写、PDF 批注时请使用 iOS App。</view>
</view>
